<title>POLAND: Polish bourse kerb bond deals - September 13.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse kerb bond deals - September 13.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friday's kerb trade on the Warsaw bourse saw 6,000 fixed-interest two-year bonds maturing on October 12, 1998 trading at 94.20 zlotys.</p>
<p>Their turnover was 5.8 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
